{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And the people contended with Moses.</b> The contention with Moses lay in their saying, ״וְלָמָה הֲבֵאתֶם אֶת קְהַל ה׳ אֶל הַמִּדְבָּר הַזֶּה״. Yet it was also against the blessed God, as He testified in saying (Numbers 20:13), ״אֲשֶׁר רָבוּ בְנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל אֶת ה׳״ — and this was in their saying, ״וְלָמָה הֶעֱלִיתֻנוּ מִמִּצְרָיִם״."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :register {:flags {0 ["God"]}}, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:40:22.885650203Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}